{
  "hypothesis": "容器内JVM发生堆内存耗尽：JFR与docker.logs均记录java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space，栈位于Drill.exhaustHeap。容器仍运行且OOMKilled=false，主机内存使用约9.37%，可排除容器级OOM kill与主机内存紧张，但不能排除JVM堆OOM。JVM堆参数(-Xmx/-Xms)与GC轨迹未采集，Drill.exhaustHeap的调用来源及是否演练专用尚未确认，因此无法区分堆配置偏小还是分配逻辑问题。",
  "summary": "JFR事件与截断的docker.logs均显示Java heap space OOM，栈在Drill.exhaustHeap；容器Running、OOMKilled=false、RestartCount=0、内存限制512MiB，主机内存充足，事件前后CPU载荷低；docker.stats为事件后约60秒单次采样（堆使用约206MB/512MB），不代表故障峰值。未知项：JVM最大堆及GC行为、完整日志窗口、触发分配路径与业务影响。",
  "supportingEvidenceIds": [
    "jfr-7756319e-ebdc-4c1d-996a-c1737569dac1",
    "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.logs",
    "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.inspect",
    "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-host.memory",
    "inv-isess-8ed4711b-6289-429e-b81e-6da7a9bdf477-evidence-docker.stats"
  ],
  "contradictingEvidenceIds": [],
  "confidence": 0.6,
  "recommendation": "先补证再决策：1) 对仍在运行的容器采集JVM堆参数与GC/堆信息（如jcmd GC.heap_info、VM.flags），并保留heap dump与完整日志，区分堆配置不足与分配过多；2) 读取Drill.exhaustHeap对应版本源码，确认触发条件及是否演练专用，未确认前不改为猜测值；3) 仅当确认进程不可用且演练可中断时，经人工批准重启容器恢复，重启前完成取证并准备回滚；4) 修复后观察JFR无新jvm.oom、docker.logs无OutOfMemoryError、堆使用稳定低于上限。",
  "diagnosis": {
    "observations": [
      {
        "statement": "JFR事件jvm.oom记录java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space，栈顶为Drill.exhaustHeap(Drill.java:285)，事件时间05:30:25.213Z。",
        "evidenceIds": [
          "jfr-7756319e-ebdc-4c1d-996a-c1737569dac1"
        ]
      },
      {
        "statement": "docker.logs可见相同OOM异常文本与栈帧，其后出现Allocation work completed; retained memory released；该日志为截断投影（原19行，保留3段），不能视为完整故障窗口。",
        "evidenceIds": [
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.logs"
        ]
      },
      {
        "statement": "容器Running、OOMKilled=false、ExitCode=0、RestartCount=0，内存限制512MiB，NanoCpus=2e8；仅排除容器被OOM kill，不能排除JVM堆OOM。",
        "evidenceIds": [
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.inspect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "statement": "主机内存使用率约9.37%，事件前后jdk.CPULoad的jvmUser/machineTotal在0附近至约5%，未见故障期CPU压力；该指标按机器CPU归一化，不等于容器配额百分比。",
        "evidenceIds": [
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-host.memory",
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.logs"
        ]
      },
      {
        "statement": "docker.stats采样于事件后约60秒，区间CPU增量约8.3%单核（非容器配额百分比），memory usage约206MB/limit 512MiB，未反映故障峰值或OOM前内存轨迹。",
        "evidenceIds": [
          "inv-isess-8ed4711b-6289-429e-b81e-6da7a9bdf477-evidence-docker.stats"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "candidateCauses": [
      {
        "cause": "应用在Drill.exhaustHeap路径上持续分配对象直至JVM堆耗尽；堆上限与分配逻辑未取证，可能为演练构造的堆溢出。",
        "supportingEvidenceIds": [
          "jfr-7756319e-ebdc-4c1d-996a-c1737569dac1",
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.logs"
        ],
        "contradictingEvidenceIds": []
      },
      {
        "cause": "容器内存上限512MiB相对JVM堆需求可能偏紧并加剧堆OOM，但无-Xmx配置证据，无法确认。",
        "supportingEvidenceIds": [
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.inspect",
          "inv-isess-8ed4711b-6289-429e-b81e-6da7a9bdf477-evidence-docker.stats"
        ],
        "contradictingEvidenceIds": [
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-host.memory"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "uncertainties": [
      "JVM实际堆参数(-Xmx/-Xms)与容器512MiB上限的匹配关系未知，无法判断堆上限是否过小。",
      "Drill.exhaustHeap是否为演练专用代码及是否代表真实业务分配路径未知，业务影响面待确认。",
      "故障前后完整内存与GC轨迹缺失：stats仅在事件后约60秒采样一次，日志为截断投影，未知峰值与持续性。"
    ],
    "actions": [
      {
        "purpose": "evidence_collection",
        "target": "order-local-drill-20261004-053012-36c038容器的JVM堆参数与GC/堆轨迹",
        "preconditions": [
          "容器仍在运行或可重启（当前Running=true）",
          "docker与jcmd/jinfo可用"
        ],
        "operation": "采集docker.stats与docker.inspect，并通过jcmd/jinfo或容器启动命令确认实际-Xmx/-Xms与堆使用情况；若jcmd不可用，改用-XX:+PrintFlagsFinal日志。",
        "expectedResult": "获得堆上限、已用堆与GC压力，区分堆配置不足与分配过多。",
        "risk": "只读操作风险低；jcmd可能短暂停顿JVM。",
        "requiresApproval": false,
        "evidenceIds": [
          "jfr-7756319e-ebdc-4c1d-996a-c1737569dac1",
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.inspect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "repair",
        "target": "order-service-本地演练-20261004-053012-36c038的堆配置或Drill.exhaustHeap分配逻辑",
        "preconditions": [
          "已获得JVM堆参数和GC数据",
          "已确认最大堆与容器512MiB限制的关系",
          "已完成人工审批"
        ],
        "operation": "若确认为堆配置不足，在保留容器内存余量前提下调整-Xmx并重启，回滚方案为恢复原参数；若为分配逻辑问题，则修改Drill.exhaustHeap的分配。未确认前不得改为猜测值。",
        "expectedResult": "OOM不再出现，堆使用稳定低于上限。",
        "risk": "重启导致服务中断；参数过大可能引发容器OOM kill。",
        "requiresApproval": true,
        "evidenceIds": [
          "jfr-7756319e-ebdc-4c1d-996a-c1737569dac1",
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.inspect"
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "verification",
        "target": "修复后容器JFR事件与docker.logs/堆使用",
        "preconditions": [
          "修复已实施",
          "已设定观察窗口"
        ],
        "operation": "观察JFR是否再出现jvm.oom，核对docker.logs无OutOfMemoryError、docker.stats堆使用稳定低于上限。",
        "expectedResult": "观察窗口内无新OOM事件，堆使用稳定。",
        "risk": "观察窗口不足可能漏掉低频OOM。",
        "requiresApproval": false,
        "evidenceIds": [
          "jfr-7756319e-ebdc-4c1d-996a-c1737569dac1",
          "job-inc-5de24141-0b2e-4414-9152-4020455d05ff-evidence-docker.logs"
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}

